{"4330320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Summonbound", "steam_appid": 4330320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summonbound is a fantasy horde-survivor action RPG where you command a growing squad of summoned units against relentless waves of enemies. Battle through dangerous regions, unleash devastating abilities, and survive as long as you can while the odds steadily turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, summon new units through a gacha-style system featuring randomized classes, stats, and rarities. Build powerful team synergies, experiment with different squad compositions, and watch your army grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and endless combinations make every run in Summonbound a new test of skill, planning, and survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summonbound is a fantasy horde-survivor action RPG where you command a growing squad of summoned units against relentless waves of enemies. Battle through dangerous regions, unleash devastating abilities, and survive as long as you can while the odds steadily turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, summon new units through a gacha-style system featuring randomized classes, stats, and rarities. Build powerful team synergies, experiment with different squad compositions, and watch your army grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and endless combinations make every run in Summonbound a new test of skill, planning, and survival.</p>", "short_description": "Summonbound is a fantasy horde-survivor action game featuring gacha-style unit summoning, squad building, and escalating survival combat.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330320/e0e7591c9c10cb5a6e29